{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"big\": \"Y\",\n    \"small\": \"Y\",\n    \"core\": \"X\",\n    \"concise\": \"Y\",\n    \"human\": \"平\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\",\n    \"load\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"big：Y的大块保留了更多因果关系和完整意群，单看大字更容易明白人物当下的处境；X的关键词虽精准，但部分屏幕需要借助小字才能补全意思。small：Y的感受更集中地补充人物体验，旁注也能提供音乐线索而不挤占主叙述；X的小字条目较多，有些偏向音乐本身的描述。core：X更完整地保留了维护尊严与怀念旧日归属之间的反复拉扯，尤其是S08、S11、S12、S13中不回头、不愿忍让、带着想念继续生活的关键选择；Y删掉这些内容后，结尾更偏向怀念与自我安顿。concise：Y删减了不少话语和感受之间、不同屏幕之间的重复，表达更经济。human：两版主要措辞基本相同，Y的分块和省略都能结合上下文自然恢复，没有足够明确的搭配或语序问题判定一方更不自然。fine：X保留了更多有辨识度的内心体验，例如“我到底在气谁，又在想谁”“不是记忆变坏了，是它太好了”，比Y部分较概括的感受更有独特性。load：Y每屏的大块数量较少，意群边界也比较自然，虽然单块较长，但结合停留时间整体扫读更顺；X在S06、S08、S13等屏有较多短亮词，需要频繁转换视线。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "b744ff3d-1154-440b-a6e2-635691b3cb31", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261111T134449255864Z", "elapsed_seconds": 353.797, "completed_utc": "2026-11-11T13:50:43.068141+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "e19d537a43e331bf2aad328077a8dbc5521117cd7f3af33f3faae38d22bcbac8", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_cou